  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "S1と　S2　is a causative sentence connective that implies that because of S1 naturally S2 was the result and has an unintentional or undesired nuance to it\n\nFor example：\nこの間、友達と一緒にキムチの食べほうだいをしたと　おなかが　痛くなりました.\n\nThe other day, my friend(s) and I had an \"all you can eat\" kimchi party and as a natural result (of eating some much kimchi) my stomach started to hurt.",
      "html": "S1と　S2　is a causative sentence connective that implies that because of S1 naturally S2 was the result and has an unintentional or undesired nuance to it<br/><br/>For example：<br/>この間、友達と一緒にキムチの食べほうだいをしたと　おなかが　痛くなりました.<br/><br/>The other day, my friend(s) and I had an \"all you can eat\" kimchi party and as a natural result (of eating some much kimchi) my stomach started to hurt.",
      "credits_raw": "tigert",
      "content_sha256": "2cd5ec8f3b150fcb0469d12cb46666f91d2c12037b2f632cea6cb43597fdc4d3",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "と is preceded by the dictionary form.",
      "html": "と is preceded by the dictionary form.",
      "credits_raw": "pedro_cristian",
      "content_sha256": "a3fcecb075aed6cbb09e101334259c3a506245c4ed527b66d94c86a575a66bc8",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Appeared in JLPT 2 (Select verbform+particle, 見ると)",
