    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I think the 3rd exmpale looks different from others though it is still（接助）活用語の終止形に接続する。\nThis 「と」seems to imply remarks following.\n「はっきり言うと、それは不可能だ」「この場合ですと、お値段が高くなります」「ここですと、安いテレビが買えます。」",
      "html": "I think the 3rd exmpale looks different from others though it is still（接助）活用語の終止形に接続する。<br/>This 「と」seems to imply remarks following.<br/>「はっきり言うと、それは不可能だ」「この場合ですと、お値段が高くなります」「ここですと、安いテレビが買えます。」",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "ba0fe7bb426bf381e243a161af5d81fd80a4147e5e507c73a493449b02f14466",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Yeah, I wasn't sure whether to put it in a separate entry or not. In the end I settled for changing the grammar entry to \n\"(on / when) doing, if\"",
      "html": "Yeah, I wasn't sure whether to put it in a separate entry or not. In the end I settled for changing the grammar entry to <br/>\"(on / when) doing, if\"",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "db3462e952559473c4f2bc60b2d6104bc5107e5521c78d61b769947767321bbc",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
